  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### The employees do not appear in pension. Can you help?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at 11:30 AM\n\n\t\tThe payroll has processed but you have not submitted the FPS to HMRC. \n\nPlease submit the FPS and then the employees will appear in pension scheme contribution file and you can submit to your pension provider. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
